    "text": "thenorthernlight.com\nwebsite\nWhatcom County, Washington\nWhatcom County outlines 20-year growth proposal for Birch Bay\nBy Grace McCarthy,\n6 hours agoCounty planning staff presented their proposal for directing growth in Birch Bay for the next 20 years during a September 11 Whatcom County Planning Commission meeting. The plan, which would not increase the size of the Birch Bay urban growth area (UGA), includes several zoning changes that staff say will improve growth through 2045.",
